cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "awr2944_dca: Raw ADC data acquisition from the TI AWR2944EVM radar sensor in MATLAB"
version: "1.9"
abstract: "MATLAB class that configures the TI AWR2944EVM radar sensor and the DCA1000EVM capture card and returns the complete four-dimensional raw ADC data cube with a single call. Supports batch and live acquisition, reads and writes recordings in the mmWave Studio format, and includes a profile editor."
